			"Message": "style(Output): Convert tab indentation to spaces in source shell scripts\n\nThe Source/Run.sh and Source/prepublishOnly.sh have been converted from hard tabs to 2-space indentation using spaces, which matches the project's shell script convention. This corrects formatting drift and aligns with hermes-shell-hooks linting standards.\n\nAdditionally, the shell-style comments (#) in these files were reformatted to ensure consistent syntax per the shellscript-maintenance skill hardening check.",
